  "title": "Banana Coconut Loaf",
  "description": "The tropical blend of bananas and coconut distinguish this sweet bread that also incorporates walnuts, almond flavoring and maraschino cherries. It lends itself to other variations just as well: Try pineapple or lemon zest instead of cherries.",
  "authors": [
